MODIFIED
--------
The files listed below are derived from the upstream sources and have been
modified for integration into the hydra_vortex atlas-web service: wiring to
the hydra engine-proxy (/engine-proxy/<id>/...), the mock EMAP adapter,
i18n additions, and surfacing of /experts.json atlas failures instead of
silent degradation. They are NOT verbatim copies.

